-- 500 test profiles for development and evaluation. NOT for production.
--
-- Every account's password is:  Glance2026!
-- Sign in with the username. Emails are <username>@glancesync.test and are already verified.
--
-- The first 20 are hand-written and easy to remember (amina_k, youssef_b, salma_r, ...);
-- newbie_f and newbie_m are deliberately incomplete, to test the "complete your profile" gate.
-- The other 480 are generated: Moroccan names, 20 cities, ages 18-55, a mix of
-- orientations, 2-6 interest tags and 1-3 pictures each, plus likes (some mutual), visits and a
-- few fake-account reports so fame ratings, "liked by", "who viewed me" and connections vary.
--
-- Generated by a script with a fixed random seed, so rerunning it gives the same people.
-- Needs PostGIS and the schema already applied (start the app once first).
-- Safe to run more than once: rows that already exist are skipped.
--   psql -d glancesync_db -f src/test/resources/seed-test-users.sql

